  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 4.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he hine selfne triowan wille, do þæt be cyninges wergelde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he wishes to exculpate himself, let him do so by [an oath in the amount of] the king’s wergild.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If he wishes to clear himself [from such a charge], he shall do it by an oath equal to the king's wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he hine sylfne treowan wille, dó þæt be cyninges wergylde.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
